@startuml
title MusicFS Server 当前模块与插件边界
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Web / Client" as UI
package "Server 宿主" {
  component "app\n程序入口 / 组装 / HTTP API" as App
  component "core\n鉴权 / 配置 / 生命周期" as Core
  component "library\n来源 / 扫描 / 查询 / 歌单" as Library
  component "metadata\n识别 / 关联 / 补全 / 写回" as Metadata
  component "playback\n会话 / 流 / 定位 / 缓存" as Playback
  component "plugins\n进程 / 协议 / 账号 / 受控资源" as Host
  component "storage\nBackend / 迁移 / 媒体 / 备份" as Storage
}
package "独立插件进程" {
  component "Local Files\n本机 / 已挂载目录" as Local
  component "在线 Provider\n网易云 / QQ / Apple Music" as Online
  component "本地 Scraper\n歌词 / 封面候选" as Scraper
  component "FFmpeg / NCM\n处理 / 解密" as Audio
  component "DSP Worker\n有序无状态节点" as DSP
  component "SQLite Worker\n必需存储后端" as SQLite
}
folder "授权音乐目录" as Files
folder "Media Store\n歌词 / 封面 / 指纹等正文" as Media
folder "可重建音频缓存" as Cache
folder "按实例保护的平台凭据" as Credentials

UI --> App : 版本化 HTTP / SSE
App --> Core
App --> Library
App --> Metadata
App --> Playback
App --> Host
App --> Storage
Library --> Host : 来源 / 扫描
Metadata --> Host : 任务与授权
Playback --> Host : 输入与音频插件
Library --> Storage
Metadata --> Storage
Playback --> Storage
Host --> Local
Host --> Online
Host --> Scraper
Host --> Audio
Host --> Credentials
Host --> Files : 授权根 / 任务读取
Local --> Files : 受限读取
Audio --> DSP : 受控 PCM 通道
Playback --> Cache
Storage --> SQLite : 专用 Backend 协议
Storage --> Media : 不可变文件与发布协调

note bottom of Host
  默认由 musicfs-plugins 的九种角色分别启动进程。
  普通插件停用保存后重启生效。
  SQLite / DSP 只读管理，配置变更后重启。
  进程隔离不是操作系统沙箱。
end note
note bottom of Storage
  SQLite 保留内置兼容模式。
  Schema、迁移、事务语义与文件发布归宿主。
  数据库只保存正文索引与引用。
end note
note bottom of Online
  登录接口已接入，真实账号待验；整曲交付未实现。
  原生 NAS、Bilibili、远端 Scraper 另见设计。
end note
note bottom of App
  按功能分组，不表示严格分层或完整调用图。
  受控资源与音频数据通道不暴露给客户端。
end note
@enduml
